WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.737
Reshaping often happens after joins, and this is where major errors can occur.

00:00:05.737 --> 00:00:11.202
A join can create extra row combinations before the pivot even begins.

00:00:11.202 --> 00:00:16.652
For example, if one patient has several admissions and several lab results,

00:00:16.652 --> 00:00:22.392
joining both fact like tables only by patient can create many combinations.

00:00:22.392 --> 00:00:29.722
If you aggregate after that join, the pivot may count the same facts more than once and produce totals that are too

00:00:29.722 --> 00:00:30.438
high.
